  {
    "html": "<span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="7379f21b80edca33">佢<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>keoi5</strong><br/>he / she / it</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be / yes</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="b70bb4acc0484cf0">我<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ngo5</strong><br/>I</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="6ddec4a1f3da9adc">嘅<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ge3</strong><br/>possessive / linking particle</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="eb6476721a76ac38">家姐<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>gaa1ze1</strong><br/>older sister</span></span>。
