  {
    "html": "A: <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="670d9743542cae3e">你好<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>nei5hou2</strong><br/>hello</span></span><span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="03fe6b38e7fc21ba">呀<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>aa3</strong><br/>sentence-final particle softening statements, making questions friendly</span></span>！ <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="b70bb4acc0484cf0">我<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ngo5</strong><br/>I</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be / yes</span></span> David。
   === Hello there! I am David.
B: <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="119af509ad0770c5">早晨<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>zou2san4</strong><br/>good morning</span></span>！ <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="b70bb4acc0484cf0">我<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ngo5</strong><br/>I</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be / yes</span></span> Mary。 <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="730bcaa66436879d">呢個<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ni1go3</strong><br/>this one</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be / yes</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="b70bb4acc0484cf0">我<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ngo5</strong><br/>I</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="6ddec4a1f3da9adc">嘅<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ge3</strong><br/>possessive / linking particle</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="85bf74961e252a34">阿哥<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>aa3go1</strong><br/>older brother</span></span>。
   === Good morning! I am Mary. This is my older brother.
A: <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="670d9743542cae3e">你好<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>nei5hou2</strong><br/>hello</span></span><span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="03fe6b38e7fc21ba">呀<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>aa3</strong><br/>sentence-final particle softening statements, making questions friendly</span></span>！ <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="d7b451126e595e8a">佢哋<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>keoi5dei6</strong><br/>they</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be / yes</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="a23d45e1195dc3e3">你哋<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>nei5dei6</strong><br/>you (plural)</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="6ddec4a1f3da9adc">嘅<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ge3</strong><br/>possessive / linking particle</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="677aad1a0ee44cd6">朋友<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>pang4jau5</strong><br/>friend</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="03fe6b38e7fc21ba">呀<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>aa4</strong><br/>sentence-final particle for questions</span></span>？
